Subject: [PATCH] editor GPU field ops: erode_wind (read pass for abrasion and
 sand speed, update pass with the conservative upwind transport, slide kernels
 at the angle of repose) on the GPU; test bit equal to the CPU op

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

diff --git a/src/sdk/moho/editor/EdGpuFieldIter.cpp b/src/sdk/moho/editor/EdGpuFieldIter.cpp
